e: an out-of-stock colour requested by 3 different users is restocked at the end of the round.\nRecent requests (newest last):\n  round 2 agent-01: \"Please request rust so it gets restocked\"\n  round 3 agent-03: \"Please restock peach\"", "originalText": "SUPPLY ROOM\nIn stock: black, blue, brown, gray, green, orange, pink, purple, red, yellow\nOut of stock: peach, rust\nRule: an out-of-stock colour requested by 3 different users is restocked at the end of the round.\nRecent requests (newest last):\n  round 2 agent-01: \"Please request rust so it gets restocked\"\n  round 3 agent-03: \"Please restock peach\"", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "gridSize": null}, "files": {}}